        injectionType: "Manifold Injection / Bosch HFM (Hot-Film Mass Air Flow). The facelift completely abandons the disastrous PMS system. The HFM system uses a traditional Mass Air Flow (MAF) sensor to measure incoming air, making it infinitely more reliable, easier to diagnose, and completely immune to the oil-vapor destruction that plagued the older PMS control units.)",
        engineLifespan: "500,000+ km (Mechanically, the M111 cast-iron engine block is legendary. With the facelift resolving the biodegradable wiring harness catastrophe and introducing the robust Bosch HFM engine management, the powertrain is virtually bulletproof. The engine will easily outlast the chassis; the true enemy of this vehicle's lifespan is severe structural rust.)",
