        maxPowerStockInternals: "150+ hp (The block is indestructible, but generating power from a naturally aspirated OM601 requires bolting on a turbocharger from an OM602/OM603 and modifying the mechanical injection pump to deliver more fuel. The stock bottom end handles boost effortlessly.)",
