          "Balance Shaft Gear Wear: THE absolute most critical flaw on pre-2007 engines. The gear wears out, requiring full engine removal to fix.",
          "Intake Manifold Swirl Flaps: The variable length intake manifold uses plastic actuator arms. The heat cycles make the plastic brittle, causing the arms to snap off. This requires a full intake manifold replacement or an aluminum arm repair kit.",
